<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="d13aAjan809" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Working with Clauses</title>
   <prolog>
      <author>Chris Castro</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Oct 10, 2016"/>
      </critdates>
      <metadata>
         <prodinfo>
            <prodname>X-Author for Contracts Mac May 2017 User Guide</prodname>
         </prodinfo>
      </metadata>
   </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>The <uicontrol>Clauses</uicontrol> section of the Document Panel lists all smart clauses in
         the agreement document. </p>
      <p>Use the Document Panel to take the following actions on clauses:</p>
      <ul>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_view_a_clause.dita#WorkingwithClauses_viewclause" format="dita">Navigate
               to a clause in the document.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_reject_changes_to_a_clause.dita#WorkingwithClauses_rejectclause"
               format="dita">Reject changes to a clause.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_mark_a_clause_for_deletion.dita#WorkingwithClauses_deleteclause"
               format="dita">Mark a clause for deletion.</xref>
         </li>
         <li>
            <xref href="to_unmark_a_clause.dita#WorkingwithClauses_unmarkClause" format="dita"
               >Unmark a clause.</xref>
         </li>
      </ul>
   </conbody>
</concept>